  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 302.08 Social Security Numbers. Unless otherwise stated in these rules, all applications shall include the applicant’s social security number pursuant to RSA 161-B:11.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.09)",
